    {
      "statement_id": "TODA-S000001",
      "chapter": 1,
      "section": "Chapter I",
      "order_key": "1",
      "kind": "Lemma",
      "locator": "Lemma 1.1",
      "tex_label": "lem:double-coset",
      "source_line": 545,
      "source_statement_tex": "% Lem1.1\n$\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n$ は,\n$[\\Ex^{n+1}W, Z]$ の中で,\n次の部分群の double coset である.\n\\[\n[\\Ex^{n+1}X, Z]\\circ \\Ex^{n+1}\\gamma, \\qquad\n\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\!\\bigl([\\Ex W, Y]\\bigr).\n\\]\n$[\\Ex^{n+1}W, Z]$ が可換,\n特に, $n>0$ あるいは, $W=\\Ex W'$ または, $Z=\\Omega Z'$ のとき, \\\\\n\\(\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n\\)\nは, 次の部分群の coset である.\n\\[\n[\\Ex^{n+1}X, Z]\\circ \\Ex^{n+1}\\gamma \\ +\\ \n\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\!\\bigl([\\Ex W, Y]\\bigr).\n\\]",
      "statement_type": "double_coset",
      "summary_en": "Toda bracket is a double coset; under commutativity it is a coset.",
      "hypotheses_en": "Composites defining the secondary composition vanish.",
      "internal_clause_markers": [],
      "source_status": "unchecked",
      "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
      "search_status": "unconnected",
      "existing_component_keys": [],
      "legacy_identity_status": "unverified",
      "source_statement_sha256": "45eb1f618e821a75022c750e5921f33e6a27096d8b00aac8a2e370ad5e3433c4",
      "registry_status": "reserved",
      "review_status": "supplied_tex_reviewed",
      "source_offset": 13329,
      "entry_scope": "named_statement"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "TODA-S000002",
      "chapter": 1,
      "section": "Chapter I",
      "order_key": "2",
      "kind": "Proposition",
      "locator": "Proposition 1.2",
      "tex_label": "prop:1-2",
      "source_line": 687,
      "source_statement_tex": "\\leavevmode\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item[$0).$] $\\alpha$, $\\beta$, $\\gamma$ のうち, いずれかが $0$ なら,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\\equiv0.\n\\]\n\\item[$i).$] $\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\beta=\\beta\\circ\\gamma=0$ のとき,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\\circ\\Ex^{n+1}\\delta\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n \\beta, \\Ex^n(\\gamma\\circ\\delta)\\}_n.\n\\]\n\\item[$ii).$] $\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\beta=\\beta\\circ\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ のとき,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n(\\gamma\\circ\\delta)\\}_n\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n(\\beta\\circ\\gamma),\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n .\n\\]\n\\item[$iii).$] $\\alpha\\circ\\Ex^n\\beta\\circ\\Ex^n\\gamma=\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ なら,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha\\circ\\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma,\\ \\Ex^n\\delta)\\}_n\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n(\\beta\\circ\\gamma),\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n .\n\\]\n\\item[$iv).$] $\\beta\\circ\\Ex^n\\gamma=\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ のとき,\n\\[\n\\alpha\\circ\\{\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma,\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha\\circ\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma,\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n .\n\\]\n\\end{enumerate}",
      "statement_type": "composition_properties",
      "summary_en": "Five separate zero and composition inclusion properties of secondary compositions.",
      "hypotheses_en": "Specified zero-composite conditions for each clause.",
      "internal_clause_markers": [
        "$0).$",
        "$i).$",
        "$ii).$",
        "$iii).$",
        "$iv).$"
      ],
      "source_status": "unchecked",
      "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
      "search_status": "unconnected",
      "existing_component_keys": [],
      "legacy_identity_status": "unverified",
      "source_statement_sha256": "5da5f2992310108dbaad895bb5d3f5f60d7d753161661a144aff4fc203d6fbe6",
      "registry_status": "reserved",
      "review_status": "supplied_tex_reviewed",
      "source_offset": 16312,
      "entry_scope": "named_statement"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "TODA-S000003",
      "chapter": 1,
      "section": "Chapter I",
      "order_key": "3",
      "kind": "Proposition",
      "locator": "Proposition 1.3",
      "tex_label": "prop:1-3",
      "source_line": 740,
      "source_statement_tex": "任意の $n\\ge 0$ に対し,\n\\[\n-\\Omega_0\\bigl\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^{n+1}\\beta,\\ \\Ex^{n+1}\\gamma\\bigr\\}_{n+1}\n=\n\\bigl\\{\\Omega_0\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^{n}\\beta,\\ \\Ex^{n}\\gamma\\bigr\\}_n \\ ,\n\\]\n\\[\n-\\Ex\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n\\subset\n\\bigl\\{E\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^{n+1}\\beta,\\ \\Ex^{n+1}\\gamma\\bigr\\}_{n+1}.\n\\]",
      "statement_type": "loop_and_suspension",
      "summary_en": "Looping identity and suspension inclusion for secondary compositions.",
      "hypotheses_en": "n >= 0.",
      "internal_clause_markers": [],
      "source_status": "unchecked",
      "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
      "search_status": "unconnected",
      "existing_component_keys": [],
      "legacy_identity_status": "unverified",
      "source_statement_sha256": "f6d45f8f65b07feed1f7618b26c6293faa210d3855ebad6676313f7345096aea",
      "registry_status": "reserved",
      "review_status": "supplied_tex_reviewed",
      "source_offset": 17921,
      "entry_scope": "named_statement"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "TODA-S000004",
      "chapter": 1,
      "section": "Chapter I",
      "order_key": "4",
      "kind": "Proposition",
      "locator": "Proposition 1.4",
      "tex_label": "prop:1-4",
      "source_line": 826,
      "source_statement_tex": "$\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\beta=\\beta\\circ\\gamma=\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ のとき, \n次が成り立つ.\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\\circ\\Ex^{n+1}\\delta\n=\n(-1)^{n+1}\\bigl(\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\{\\beta,\\ \\gamma,\\ \\delta\\}\\bigr).\n\\]",
      "statement_type": "composition_relation",
      "summary_en": "Relation between right composition of a bracket and left composition of another bracket, with sign.",
      "hypotheses_en": "Three consecutive zero-composite conditions.",
      "internal_clause_markers": [],
      "source_status": "unchecked",
      "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
      "search_status": "unconnected",
      "existing_component_keys": [],
      "legacy_identity_status": "unverified",
      "source_statement_sha256": "34bf39864aa14f3db638918d2d35a578cb913b703926441d8c87632e2da0ab7c",
      "registry_status": "reserved",
      "review_status": "supplied_tex_reviewed",
      "source_offset": 19914,
      "entry_scope": "named_statement"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "TODA-S000005",
      "chapter": 1,
      "section": "Chapter I",
      "order_key": "5",
      "kind": "Proposition",
      "locator": "Proposition 1.5",
      "tex_label": "prop:1-5",
      "source_line": 917,
      "source_statement_tex": "$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta,\\varepsilon$ を,\n\\[\n\\alpha\\circ \\beta=\\beta\\circ\\gamma=\\gamma\\circ\\delta=\\delta\\circ\\varepsilon=0\n\\]\n\\[\n0\\in \\alpha\\circ\\{\\beta,\\ \\gamma,\\ \\delta\\}, \\ \\ 0\\in\\{\\beta,\\ \\gamma,\\ \\delta\\}\\circ\\Ex\\varepsilon\n\\]\nを満たす元とする. このとき,\n\\[\n\\lambda\\in\\{\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\},\\quad\n\\mu\\in\\{\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta\\},\\quad\n\\nu\\in\\{\\gamma,\\delta,\\varepsilon\\}\n\\]\nを適当に選ぶことができ, それらは,\n\\[\n\\lambda\\circ \\Ex\\delta=\\alpha\\circ \\mu=0,\\qquad\n\\beta\\circ \\nu=\\mu\\circ \\Ex\\varepsilon=0\n\\]\nを満たし, 次の和は $0$ を含む. \n\\[\n\\{\\lambda,\\ \\Ex\\delta,\\ \\Ex\\varepsilon\\}\n\\ +\\\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\mu,\\ \\Ex\\varepsilon\\}\n\\ +\\\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\beta,\\ \\nu\\}.\n\\]",
      "statement_type": "higher_coherence",
      "summary_en": "Under specified vanishing conditions, a sum of three secondary compositions contains zero.",
      "hypotheses_en": "Four consecutive zero composites and two bracket-composite zero-memberships.",
      "internal_clause_markers": [],
      "source_status": "unchecked",
      "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
      "search_status": "unconnected",
      "existing_component_keys": [],
      "legacy_identity_status": "unverified",
      "source_statement_sha256": "dd42f08a8764850f74eddf86e6ddf9d0fce29fdb71466f7632c45bd6c96392c7",
      "registry_status": "reserved",
      "review_status": "supplied_tex_reviewed",
      "source_offset": 22070,
      "entry_scope": "named_statement"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "TODA-S000006",
      "chapter": 1,
      "section": "Chapter I",
      "order_key": "6",
      "kind": "Proposition",
      "locator": "Proposition 1.6",
      "tex_label": "prop:1-6",
      "source_line": 956,
      "source_statement_tex": "% Prop1.6\n$\\alpha,\\alpha'\\in[\\Ex^n Y, Z]$, $\\beta,\\beta'\\in[X, Y]$, \n$\\gamma,\\gamma'\\in[W, X]$ とする. \\\\\n$n\\ge 1$ \\emph{または} $W=\\Ex W'$ の場合には,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n+\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma'\\}_n\n\\ \\supset\\\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n(\\gamma+\\gamma')\\}_n\n\\]\nが成り立つ. \n$n\\ge 1$ \\emph{または} $\\gamma=\\Ex\\gamma' \\ (X=\\Ex X,\\ W=\\Ex W')$ の場合には,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n+\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta',\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n\\ =\\\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n(\\beta+\\beta'),\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n,\n\\]\nが成り立つ. $n\\ge 1$ \\emph{または} $\\beta=\\Ex\\beta',\\ \\gamma=\\Ex\\gamma' \\ (Y=\\Ex Y',\\ X=\\Ex X',\\ W=\\Ex W')$ の場合には\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n+\n\\{\\alpha',\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n\\ \\supset\\\n\\{\\alpha+\\alpha',\\Ex^n\\beta,\\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\n\\]\nが成り立つ.",
      "statement_type": "additivity",
      "summary_en": "Three conditional additivity relations for secondary compositions.",
      "hypotheses_en": "Dimension or suspension-space restrictions specific to each relation.",
      "internal_clause_markers": [],
      "source_status": "unchecked",
      "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
      "search_status": "unconnected",
      "existing_component_keys": [],
      "legacy_identity_status": "unverified",
      "source_statement_sha256": "3e3d429551c1787b83afdf4a19929719932235c35fcfd35273a159096bce6f33",
      "registry_status": "reserved",
      "review_status": "supplied_tex_reviewed",
      "source_offset": 23003,
      "entry_scope": "named_statement"
    },
